---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-oq-black text-white mt-16">
  <div class="oq-container py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <div class="col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="font-extrabold text-white text-xl tracking-tight">OQORO</span>
          <span class="text-white/40">|</span>
          <span class="text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/80">Off Market</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-white/70 max-w-sm">
          Les biens en gestion OQORO à la vente. Des données locatives réelles,
          certifiées, et vérifiées par nos équipes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/80 mb-3">
          Découvrir
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px] text-white/70">
          <li><a href="/#biens" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white no-underline">Nos biens</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#pourquoi" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white no-underline">Notre approche</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://oqoro.com" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white no-underline">oqoro.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/80 mb-3">
          Contact
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px] text-white/70">
          <li><a href="mailto:offmarket@oqoro.com" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white no-underline">offmarket@oqoro.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-4 text-[13px] text-white/50">
      <span>© {year} OQORO. Tous droits réservés.</span>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="/mentions-legales" class="text-white/50 hover:text-white no-underline">Mentions légales</a>
        <a href="/confidentialite" class="text-white/50 hover:text-white no-underline">Confidentialité</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
